DISCONNECTED exactly once through the same claim paired transports use (no STREAM-only branch, no second event path). Rule count: termination observation
2 → 1 (paired: shared claim / raw: engine publish → one claim). Preserve D-092 (event at peer termination) and the no-duplicate guarantee.

